# tighten edl - in and out points in seconds, one segment a line.
#
# The three takes of media/foolish-showcase.mp4, in order. Each is a single
# continuous stretch of the source with nothing cut out of the middle of it.
#
# Source: a 19m46s iPhone screen recording of one game of Foolish played with
# Eva inside Messages. It is not in the repo; it was 744 MB.
#
# See README.md in this directory for the crop, the fades and the two places in
# the source that must not be shown.

  125.80   153.20   # 27.40s  her three dots; her 6 of diamonds thrown in and
                    #         animating down the board; you pick the king of
                    #         diamonds and cover with it; you send; the board
                    #         expands to full screen; the pickup sweep and the
                    #         refill. One take, no cut.
  692.00   703.00   # 11.00s  her three dots; her ace covers your 7 of spades;
                    #         you throw in a 7 of hearts; you send.
  778.80   794.50   # 15.70s  her three dots; her cover; you call Good; the bout
                    #         sweeps off the table and sends.
